        "content": "## Tracking state setup\n\nWorkflow now uses the native n8n Data Table before Apify.\n\nCreate/check these columns in the selected Data Table:\n- `url` string\n- `shortcode` string\n- `tracking_status` string\n- `last_checked_at` dateTime\n- `last_growth_at` dateTime\n- `last_views`, `last_likes`, `last_comments` number\n- `delta_views`, `delta_likes`, `delta_comments` number\n- `no_growth_checks` number\n- `next_check_at` dateTime\n\nLogic: new/due posts go to Apify; no-growth posts move to `cooldown` after 1 check and `paused_no_growth` after 3 no-growth checks. Paused posts are rechecked after 7 days.",
